sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service<br/>(API + Order DB)
    participant OR as Saga Orchestrator<br/>(Order Service)
    participant MB as Message Broker
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant PG as Gateway Financeiro<br/>(externo)

    C->>GW: POST /orders (itens, meio de pagamento) [sync]
    GW->>OS: POST /orders [sync]
    OS->>OS: TX local: Order=PENDING, Saga=STARTED, Outbox
    OS-->>GW: 202 Accepted (orderId, status=PENDING)
    GW-->>C: 202 Accepted (orderId)

    Note over OR,MB: A partir daqui tudo é assíncrono (command/reply)

    OR->>MB: ReserveStock (sagaId, orderId, itens)
    MB->>IS: ReserveStock
    IS->>IS: TX local: reserva estoque + grava messageId
    IS->>MB: StockReserved (sagaId)
    MB->>OR: StockReserved
    OR->>OR: Saga=STOCK_RESERVED

    OR->>MB: ProcessPayment (sagaId, orderId, valor)
    MB->>PS: ProcessPayment
    PS->>PG: POST /charges [sync, timeout 5s, Idempotency-Key=sagaId]
    PG-->>PS: 200 aprovado
    PS->>PS: TX local: Payment=APPROVED + grava messageId
    PS->>MB: PaymentApproved (sagaId)
    MB->>OR: PaymentApproved
    OR->>OR: Saga=PAYMENT_APPROVED

    OR->>MB: CommitStock (sagaId)
    MB->>IS: CommitStock
    IS->>IS: TX local: reserva vira baixa definitiva
    IS->>MB: StockCommitted (sagaId)
    MB->>OR: StockCommitted

    OR->>OS: TX local: Order=APPROVED, Saga=COMPLETED
    OR->>MB: OrderApproved (evento de domínio)
    C->>GW: GET /orders/orderId (consulta ou notificação)
    GW-->>C: status=APPROVED
